        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents I08-P7540-627 4 House Number Address Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-3/4\" high satin aluminum numbers of this Four Number Address Plate really stand out against the black plate background color. The vintage font along with the old world feel of this house address number marker makes it perfect for traditional homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <b>Four (4) Numbers</b>. The entire address numbers and frame are made of non rusting aluminum with a satin powder coat finish. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/three-number-address-plate-brass-accents-i08-p7530-627\"><b>3 Number Address Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/five-number-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7550-627\"><b>5 Number Address Plate</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4-house-address-plate-example.jpg?v=1704442267\" width=\"430\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents 4 House Number Address Plate Example\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents I08-P7540-627 4 House Number Address Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Number Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Non Rusting Aluminum and  Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Aluminum</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with 4 numbers, frame, back plate and mounting screws for easy installation. Assembled and Finished in the USA. Usually ships in one week.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBelow select your 4 address numbers in the order required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
